Z||000000||FOCOSEVA||07-24-2001||11:59 AM||||Folks, if you're concerned because you're coming from way out West and that your registration may not arrive in time, here's an idea. You can mail it from your Post Office and request "2-day Priority Mail". It will cost a little more, but it will surely get here in a hurry. Even if it doesn't GET HERE before the registration deadline, it will arrive in plenty of time. Thanks, and don't worry. We'll see you there. Curry Obenshain<P>Fiero Festival<BR>P.O. Box 297<BR>White Marsh, Va. 23183||||reg||4
